  "prefLabel": "Hum 305.02 Objections to Motions for Continuance and Rescheduling",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Hum 305.02 Objections to Motions for Continuance and Rescheduling. Objections to motions for continuance and rescheduling shall be:\n\n(a) Filed within 10 days of the filing date of the motions objected to, if the motions are in writing; and\n\n(b) Made at once, if the motions are made orally.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Hum 300) #8815-A, eff 2-3-07",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/hum100-300.html"
